    - Include at least one horizontal same-color adjacency for task interest.
    - Optionally include a vertical same-color pair where neither endpoint has a
      horizontal same-color neighbor, to exercise the V-connection rule.
    - Verify _axis_spans divisibility (guaranteed by R,C choice).
